+**Campaign story traffic** (`RadioNet`, all campaign levels): briefings,
+check-ins and the other ships on the frequency are whole recorded
+transmissions rather than stitched words — one clip per line, scripted in
+`src/audio/radioScript.json` and recorded by the same `generateClips.js` into
